{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117936","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117936/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117936/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117936/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117936","id":4161112355,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc74BYkj","number":117936,"title":"(Range) set_value() does not decrease bar when using float","user":{"login":"MatthewBakley","id":35856801,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODU2ODAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35856801?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley","html_url":"https://github.com/MatthewBakley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-03-28T17:59:21Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T04:19:40Z","closed_at":"2026-03-30T04:02:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.6.1\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11, AMD Ryzen 5 7600X 6-Core Processor, 64-bit operating system\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using TextureProgressBar, set_value() does not work for decimal values. Instead, it rounds to the nearest int. Though the description of Float.value in the documentation shows value to be a float. This is misleading.\n<img width=\"357\" height=\"110\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6cf9dbe-7112-4e3f-8a8e-1ab115faa2ec\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nYou can play with the drain_speed and fill_speed to see that it rounds to the nearest int\n\nGDScript for TextureProgressBar:\n\n> **Bugsquad edit:** fixed code formatting\n\n```gdscript\nextends TextureProgressBar\n@export var start_value = 300\n@export var drain_speed = 0.3\n@export var fill_speed = 0.8\n\n# Called when the node enters the scene tree for the first time.\nfunc _ready():\n\tset_value_no_signal(start_value)\n\n# Called every frame. 'delta' is the elapsed time since the previous frame.\nfunc _process(delta: float, ) -> void:\n\tif Input.is_action_pressed(\"mouse_button_left\"):\n\t\tset_value(get_value() + fill_speed)\n\t\tprint(\"left mouse click: \" + str(get_value()))\n\telse:\n\t\tprint(\"get_value before: \" + str(get_value()))\n\t\tset_value(get_value() - drain_speed) \n\t\tprint(\"get_value after: \" + str(get_value()))\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[progress_bar_bug_2026-03-28_13-57-16.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26325224/progress_bar_bug_2026-03-28_13-57-16.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"MatthewBakley","id":35856801,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODU2ODAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35856801?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley","html_url":"https://github.com/MatthewBakley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthewBakley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117936/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117936/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}